          <para>See the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/99b01a65cc4c104933788b3143285ab6bae65827/graphics/java/android/graphics/text/LineBreaker.java">Android 16 builder defaults</a></format>.</para>
